    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d113">

                <pb facs="0237" n="223" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg223"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to
                        the British Prime Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Churchill</hi>)<anchor n="61" xml:id="d113-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-05-27">27 May, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>545. For the Former Naval Person. I propose that the Combined Chiefs of Staff be
                    directed by both of us to send the following message to Eisenhower: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“You are hereby directed to make such plans as are practicable to send
                            American troops to the Netherlands and northwest Germany as forces of
                            occupation when hostilities with Germany cease. For planning purposes,
                            the area in Germany to be occupied by U.S. Forces will comprise the
                            states of Schleswig, Hanover, Brunswick, Westphalia, Hesse-Nassau and
                            the Rhine Province.</p>
                        <p>It will be assumed in this plan that France, Austria, and the Balkans
                            will not be included in an American zone of responsibility and that
                            Berlin will be occupied jointly by the U.S., British and Soviet
                            Forces.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
